      <p begin="00:01.910" end="00:03.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Pulled up in the wintertime (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:03.850" end="00:05.550" ttm:agent="v1">Drop-top, bet you're feelin' mine</p>
      <p begin="00:05.550" end="00:08.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Bad-bad -, get it, huh? (Yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:08.330" end="00:09.830" ttm:agent="v1">She get it, huh</p>
      <p begin="00:09.580" end="00:11.940" ttm:agent="v1">Two doors open, I'm in and out</p>
      <p begin="00:11.940" end="00:13.490" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Eatin' on Benihana (eatin' on)</p>
      <p begin="00:13.490" end="00:16.320" ttm:agent="v1">Eatin' on, eatin' on Benihana</p>
      <p begin="00:16.320" end="00:19.840" ttm:agent="v1">I wanna, I wanna</p>
      <p begin="00:19.840" end="00:21.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">LV bag, swag on me (LV bag)</p>
      <p begin="00:21.780" end="00:23.650" ttm:agent="v1">Throwin' up cash, club ecstasy</p>
      <p begin="00:23.650" end="00:25.630" ttm:agent="v1">Shawty shake -, get cash for free</p>
      <p begin="00:25.630" end="00:29.130" ttm:agent="v1">Shawty shake - for the Cash App fee</p>
      <p begin="00:29.130" end="00:30.630" ttm:agent="v1">Uh</p>
      <p begin="00:30.480" end="00:32.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Ooh, we feelin' right (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:32.560" end="00:34.550" ttm:agent="v1">It's one of those nights</p>
      <p begin="00:34.550" end="00:36.770" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Everything feelin' right (right)</p>
      <p begin="00:36.770" end="00:38.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You can feel it, right? (Uh)</p>
      <p begin="00:38.320" end="00:40.710" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, you can feel it, right?</p>
      <p begin="00:40.710" end="00:43.010" ttm:agent="v1">You can feel it, right?</p>
      <p begin="00:43.010" end="00:45.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">The strobes from the lights, girl (girl)</p>
      <p begin="00:45.140" end="00:47.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">The flash in her eyes (ooh)</p>
      <p begin="00:47.160" end="00:49.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">She's a single friend of mine (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:49.420" end="00:50.920" ttm:agent="v1">Make the girls cry</p>
      <p begin="00:50.820" end="00:53.130" ttm:agent="v1">She keep singin' in the night</p>
      <p begin="00:53.130" end="00:55.110" ttm:agent="v1">As if you Gemini</p>
      <p begin="00:55.110" end="00:57.770" ttm:agent="v1">Like we do tonight</p>
      <p begin="00:57.770" end="00:59.270" ttm:agent="v1">I wanna, I wanna</p>
      <p begin="00:59.220" end="01:01.030" ttm:agent="v1">It's alright, I'll be okay</p>
      <p begin="01:01.030" end="01:02.930" ttm:agent="v1">Made like 50K today</p>
      <p begin="01:02.930" end="01:04.980" ttm:agent="v1">You can go or you can stay</p>
      <p begin="01:04.980" end="01:06.950" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me when you're ready to leave this place</p>
      <p begin="01:06.950" end="01:08.990" ttm:agent="v1">Hundreds in my bag, don't need no more</p>
      <p begin="01:08.990" end="01:11.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Up all night 'til I break the code (code)</p>
